> tap chat.nope
no row chat.nope in the committed tree (tree lists them)
> type chat.title hello
chat.title is a heading, not a field: nothing was typed
> tap
tap takes an id from the tree
> clock +abc
clock +MS: MS is a whole number of ms, at most 600000
> clock until
clock until NAME [OP VALUE] [within MS]: OP is ==, !=, <, >, <= or >=
> state account.token
account.token is never shown: state reads an allowlist, and no credential is on it
> state nothing.here
no state named nothing.here (state lists what can be read)
> clock data release nothing
nothing held named nothing (clock data lists what is held)
> clock data record not a line
not a recording line: NAME: KIND KEY => STATUS BODY (KIND http or auth)
> host
host cpu: agent clock, seed 13096, 2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z, en-US, UTC
operations: tree, layout [ID], tap ID, type ID TEXT, drag ID DX DY, scroll ID DX DY, state [NAME], logs, counts, host, clock, clock +MS, clock settle [within MS], clock until NAME [OP VALUE] [within MS], clock data [release|lose|fail NAME], clock data record LINE, life background|foreground|relaunch
text enters through the shared edit buffer
not on this host: screenshot
